"{    \"translations\": [        {            \"english_version\": \"Trump has threatened Oman, which is talking with Iran to reopen the Strait of Hormuz. This happens as a 60-day period for peace talks ends.\",            \"english_title\": \"Trump Threatens Oman\",            \"translated_version\": \"Trump ha amenazado a Om\u00e1n, que est\u00e1 hablando con Ir\u00e1n para reabrir el Estrecho de Ormuz. Esto pasa cuando termina un periodo de 60 d\u00edas para charlas de paz.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Trump amenaza a Om\u00e1n\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"The prosecution has started calling witnesses in the trial of Duane 'Keffe D' Davis, who says he is not guilty of the 1996 murder.\",            \"english_title\": \"Trial of Duane Davis\",            \"translated_version\": \"La fiscal\u00eda ha empezado a llamar testigos en el juicio de Duane 'Keffe D' Davis, quien dice que no es culpable del asesinato de 1996.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Juicio de Duane Davis\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"An Australian woman, known for poisoning her family, is trying to overturn her conviction.\",            \"english_title\": \"Australian Woman Appeals\",            \"translated_version\": \"Una mujer australiana, conocida por envenenar a su familia, est\u00e1 tratando de cambiar su condena.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Mujer australiana apela\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"Moscow reports nine people killed in the last day, while Kyiv says four people have died.\",            \"english_title\": \"Casualties in Moscow and Kyiv\",            \"translated_version\": \"Mosc\u00fa informa que nueve personas murieron en el \u00faltimo d\u00eda, mientras que Kyiv dice que cuatro personas han muerto.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Muertes en Mosc\u00fa y Kyiv\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"Lev Schlosberg has been found guilty of 'discrediting' Russia's army, which he says is punishment for his political views.\",            \"english_title\": \"Lev Schlosberg Guilty\",            \"translated_version\": \"Lev Schlosberg ha sido encontrado culpable de 'desacreditar' al ej\u00e9rcito de Rusia, lo que \u00e9l dice es un castigo por sus opiniones pol\u00edticas.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Lev Schlosberg culpable\"        }    ]}"